              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joe Cullinan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Awesome dry rub; I left out the MSG though. Ive used this quite a bit already over the past 2 months. Always comes out great when I've used the grill. Highly recommend it!!!!",
